:: Dad Hang Out Park Playground Phone [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 20>>
<span style="color:LightGreen">You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> are messing around at the park. Following a teasing remark from you and some playful threats of spanking from him, he started chasing you around the jungle gym!</span> Though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> isn’t as young as he once was, needing to catch his breath more than once and you intentionally slow down occasionally to at least give him a chance at catching you. At one point, he even pretends to stop to catch his breath just so you’ll slow down, before suddenly sprinting forward and nearly grabbing you! <br>

<<set _ad to [
    {
        Name: "Dad",
        State: {
            Outfit: "Everyday",
            Mouth: "Smirk",
        },
    },
    {
        Name: "Player",
        State: {
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Mad",
        },
    },
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

This proves to be a mistake on his part, however, as he stumbles forward and nearly crashes into the sand as he loses his balance, only just able to steady himself by grabbing the edge of a ladder. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Whew, that was a close one. Huh?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> suddenly feels something strange, or more so the lack of something. He taps his pocket, realizing it is empty, before turning around to see his cell phone in the sand. He sighs in relief, but you’ve already come up with a devious plan as you lunge forward and grab it before he can! <br>
<br>
<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>! Hey! Give that back!”</span> He tries to grab you, but you duck and weave, leaping up part of the jungle gym and climbing to the top, holding <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s phone out tauntingly. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Very funny. Give it back.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> holds out his hand, but you just smirk and wave the phone about. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Haha, have your fun, but if you drop that your butt will end up redder than a tomato.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He rolls his eyes with a smirk, mumbling something about you being a <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“little shit”</span> under his breath.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="color:Yellow">Then the phone rings.</span> The sudden noise actually does almost cause you to drop it, though you thankfully manage to hold on. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s eyes widen as he hears it ring, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hey, that’s probably my work, toss it here!”</span> He holds his hands out, reaching up so you can hand it to him. <span style="color:Yelloow">You hesitate for a moment, glancing down at the phone screen.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Hand it to him<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        Not wanting to risk getting into actually trouble, you kneel down and carefully hand the phone to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>. You are a bit sad that your playtime with him has been interrupted, though listen in once you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> chuckling as he sees whose number it is and answers the phone in a much more causally way. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hey, what’s up?”</span> He says as he answers, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Just out with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>, A.K.A. Pain in the Butt.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You blush a little, wondering who he is telling such things to!</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, I should still be able to do that Saturday. I’ll check my schedule for that day and get back to you later. Okay. Sure, see you later!”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Dad",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        He hangs up with a grin, slipping his phone back into his pocket and tapping it twice. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry about that, it was <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span>. He says hi.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Your blush deepens at the idea that you were called a pain in the butt to your headmaster, often forgetting that he’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s best friend.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">The two of you continue to play around for a bit longer, though he is careful to not give you another chance to snatch his phone.</span> <br>
        <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 15>>
        <<socialChange "Dad" 3>>
        <span style="color:green">+Dad Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Dad Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 10>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Dad Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Tell him to come get it<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">With a devious, shit-eating grin, you hold his phone out and tell him to climb up and get it.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> frowns before sighing, looking up at you with an amused yet annoyed smirk. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s right, you are a pain in the butt.”</span> You laugh and watch as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> hurriedly climbs up the jungle gym made for people much smaller than him as the phone keeps ringing. Once he is just about up, you think about taking off to run, but he seems to expect that. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Run off with my phone and I’ll spank your butt right here!”</span> He threatens playfully as he finishes climb up. Not wanting to risk it, you hand the phone over to him and he quickly answers it. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:Yellow">You are a bit sad that your playtime with him has been interrupted,</span> though listen in once you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> chuckling as he sees whose number it is and answers the phone in a much more causal way. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Hey, what’s up?”</span> He says as he answers, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Just out with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>, A.K.A. Pain in the Butt.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You blush a little, wondering who he is telling such things to!</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, I should still be able to do that Saturday. I’ll check my schedule for that day and get back to you later. Okay. Sure, see you later!”</span> <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Dad",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Happy",
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        He hangs up with a grin, slipping his phone back into his pocket and tapping it twice. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Sorry about that, it was <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span>. He says hi.”</span> <span style="color:Pink">Your blush deepens at the idea that you were called a pain in the butt to your headmaster, often forgetting that he’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s best friend.</span> <br>
        <br>
        The two of you continue to play around for a bit longer, though he is careful to not give you another chance to snatch his phone. <br>
        <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 15>>
        <<socialChange "Dad" 3>>
        <span style="color:green">+Dad Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Dad Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 20>>
        <span style="color:green">+Dad Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Dad Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<requiresTrait "Rebellious" "Answer it">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You look down at the phone screen and then back to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>, shit-eating grin growing on your face. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Don’t you dare-!”</span> He starts to say before you suddenly hit the answer button, hold it up to your ear, and give a cringy greeting.</span> You are half expecting <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s confused boss or a client to answer but are caught off-guard when you hear a chuckle followed by a familiar voice. <br>

            <<set _ad to [
                {
                    Name: "Dad",
                    State: {
                        Outfit: "Everyday",
                        Mouth: "Frown",
                        Blush: 1,
                    },
                },
                {
                    Name: "Player",
                    State: {
                        Mouth: "Smirk",
                        Eyes: "Mad",
                    },
                },
            ]>>
            <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Well, hello there. Think I recognize who that is, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>.”</span> You blush upon hearing your own name, stuttering a bit as you quickly put together who’s on the other end. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Headmaster Alistair</span>. <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m going to assume there is a perfectly valid reason for you to be answering.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>’s voice cuts through, asking you who it is as he quickly tries to scramble up worriedly. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">laughs as he hears this,</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Guess you’re a rebel at home too. You know what would be funny? Say something that would freak him out if it were his boss on the phone, I promise to take the blame.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">With the protection of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> on your side, you say the first thing that comes to mind. A swear, loud and clear directly into the phone. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> breaks out laughing as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>, red-faced with worry and anger, practically jumps up the rest of the way and snatches the phone out of your hand.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I’m so sorry, I don’t know what-”</span> He pauses, no doubt hearing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> laughing as he looks to you with a scowl and sighs, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Very funny. I thought you were supposed to be a good influence on kids now? You jerk.”</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Alistair</span> talk for a moment and he seems to calm <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> down enough, as he eventually sighs and says that he guesses he won’t <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“spank your butt right here for saying something like that. But that was your one pass, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$DadNickname</span>. Say something like that again and-”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He mimics spanking you with his hand, causing you to chuckle and escape down the slide as he finishes his conversation before following down, though uses the path he took to get up.</span> <br>
        <<addMoodlet "Stress" 0>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 15>>
        <<socialChange "Dad" 3>>
        <<socialChange "Alistair" 3>>
        <span style="color:green">+Dad Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 10>>
        <span style="color:red">-Dad Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 20>>
        <span style="color:green">+Dad Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 10>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Dad Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</requiresTrait>>
</div>